000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfWrO1ME-JD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfWrO1ME-JD","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"看完別人的 Linux 桌面，真的會忍不住想重灌系統！🤣\n分享一個超帥的開源專案：Hyprland。\n它是基於 Wayland 的動態平鋪視窗合成器，直接把「工程師效率」和「頂級顏值」結合在一起。\n✨ 絲滑的貝茲曲線與彈簧動畫\n🪟 原生支援毛玻璃、漸層邊框與陰影\n⚡ 視窗自動平鋪，鍵盤就能快速操作\n🎨 高度客製化，打造專屬 Linux 桌面\n\n最可怕的不是它有多漂亮，而是你原本只想調個視窗，最後卻花了一整個週末美化桌面。😂\n#Linux #Hyprland #OpenSource","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:08:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfWrOtKk0wA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfWrOtKk0wA","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🔗 github.com/hyprw…\n加入「碼力獅冒險公會」！\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:08:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfZxYqCj-Sa","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZxYqCj-Sa","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"好奇大家遇過的約會地雷\n原po先分享！\n\n1.去看電影的時候，全程都用正常音量講話而不是低聲討論：）\n2.去餐廳的時候直接坐裡面，比較舒服的沙發椅，不到雷但就覺得蠻不貼心的","timestamp":"2026-11-06T14:00:28.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZxaEaj_Jc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZxaEaj_Jc","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家有遇到什麼小地雷呢🧐\n原文來自✨好奇大家遇過的約會地雷✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情相關討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-06T14:00:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZjnIaDeMA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZjnIaDeMA","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有錢的台北人都吃什麼？\n\n原po是大學生，桃園人在台中唸書\n有個好朋友是台北人\n平常一起出去玩的時候她並不會特別表現的非常有錢\n但跟她聊天有時候會透露出一些優越感\n\n昨天晚上在討論美食\n討論到某家很有名高級自助餐廳\n她說她回台北的時候常常吃，我跟她說我沒吃過\n她用有點驚訝的表情看我\n接著又說，她家也常常吃鼎*豐，我說我也沒吃過\n\n她完全藏不住，用一個傻眼的臉看著我\n然後問我「那妳們家晚餐都吃什麼？」\n我回答「我媽會煮啊⋯⋯」","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:00:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZjoXLjdSl","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZjoXLjdSl","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有沒有台北市人回答原po\n你們家晚餐常常都吃這麼貴的外食嗎？><","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:00:16.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZcyFnDCh7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZcyFnDCh7","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有沒有人可以幫忙判斷一下\n這樣是有意思還是沒意思🥺\n\n1.認識一個月，每天都會傳訊息\n2.約出去過，沒有肢體接觸\n3.他會主動跟你說他下班，分享三餐給妳看\n4.但有時候你回覆他\n他可能隔天才回你\n早安","timestamp":"2026-11-06T11:00:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":26,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":5},"score":32,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZczAmjC9g","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZczAmjC9g","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"對方到底有沒有意思啊😵‍💫\n原文來自✨穩聊VS曖昧✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情相關討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-06T11:00:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZZtcE5WG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZZZtcE5WG","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"沒看過這麼瘋狂.....QQ\n原文來自✨誰可以告訴我台股到底怎麼了 跌跌不休 國安基金救命✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多股票相關討論","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:30:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfZZYhrEym1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfZZYhrEym1","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"不用出國也可以看極光\n賺爛......\n話說有人有推薦的公園嗎比較好睡的那種","timestamp":"2026-11-