Mm8TjdZk","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"和爸媽聊政治，一定要聊到有共識嗎？🧐\nDcard 上有人問，和立場不同的爸媽溝通，每次都快吵起來\n底下有卡友談理解彼此，也有人覺得，各自保留選擇就好","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:00:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfXFywxkfS5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfXFywxkfS5","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家覺得原PO說的準嗎？🤓\n原文來自✨金牛座✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:01:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfXFxvQkcOD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfXFxvQkcOD","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一位卡友分享關於金牛座的特質：\n1. 你態度良好 我們也會很真誠的回應你\n2. 懶得吵架懶得心機 更加懶得討厭人\n3. 對朋友很好 就好像小孩子\n喜歡你就會跟你一起玩樂高\n還會分享芭比娃娃\n\n歡迎大家補充更多🙌","timestamp":"2026-11-05T13:00:56.000Z","stats":{"likes":22,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":24,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfW-18aAcrn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfW-18aAcrn","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"你們都是怎麼跟另一半過節的呢？👫\n原文來自✨關於情侶週年或生日禮物✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:00:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfW-0pBgfvJ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfW-0pBgfvJ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"剛好最近連假比較有空\n為了避免慶祝當天再次失望壞了氣氛\n我有明示他若沒事做的話\n可以準備禮物👀\n他：（小嘆氣）請你吃那頓的話算嗎\n\n我內心其實百感交集 覺得\n向來節儉的他願意花一千多請我吃飯\n好像也是頗有誠意\n但有人可以理解我想要\n「主動」、「用心」的感覺嗎🥹\n\n如果另一半沒什麼儀式感\n大家是怎麼調適這個問題的呢？🤔","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:00:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfW-zvgASO9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfW-zvgASO9","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一位卡友分享：\n和男友在一起快兩年了\n男友表示從小到大家中都沒什麼儀式感\n剛在一起後三個月左右\n剛好是我們的生日月（我們同個月份生日）\n除了一起吃慶生餐之外\n我準備了2個實用小物+手作卡片\n男友在我生日當天則是什麼都沒表示\n吃完午餐回來就躺著滑手機\n\n傍晚回來主動表達我的失落後\n他：我有陪你一起吃飯啊\n（但餐廳是我選的+我訂的…）\n解釋後 他隔天才再帶我去買禮物\n留言續","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:00:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DfaKpC3CXev","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfaKpC3CXev","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"朋友傳給我的，好事多很多人可能不知道的秘密","timestamp":"2026-11-06T17:41:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T05:57:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZn6hVFFzi","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfZn6hVFFzi","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Windows 11 26H2 的問題修到哪了？微軟狀態頁列管5項問題，其中4項已解決，但部分 USB 音效裝置異常仍只是「已緩解」，不代表全部修好。遠端桌面、黑畫面到音訊問題，哪些情境值得升級前先確認？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:37:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZn7EXlHOe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfZn7EXlHOe","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:37:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZSuVxFMBM","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfZSuVxFMBM","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"SpaceX 不只要用衛星連手機，也計畫蓋地面 5G！這次攜手高通，採用 Dragonwing 平台與64T64R大規模MIMO，規劃2027年起部署、在多年合作期間建置數萬站點。這是未來計畫，還不是全面開通，地面與衛星要怎麼搭配？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-06T09:32:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZS5iXlBGc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfZS5iXlBGc","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-06T09:34:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfY-CwkFOFL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfY-CwkFOFL","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Edits 終於把剪片空間搬上 Mac！多軌時間軸、關鍵影格與調色工具，加上4K無浮水印匯出，不必所有操作都擠在手機。需 M1以上Mac與Instagram帳號，手機／桌面接續同一專案還在開發。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:31:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfY-DU7FN0j","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfY-DU7FN0j","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:31:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfZZlZDn0RU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZlZDn0RU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"陪客戶做夢(O)\n陪客戶做自動化(X)\n\n最近對於 AI 模型的進步突然有感而發\n五個月前，同一個客戶需求\n用當時的 opus 只能跑出 6x% 的成功率\n\n而現在只需要 sonnet 5.5 \n就能跑出 99% 以上的成功率\n\n這個場景是客戶流程的一大痛點\n他們會收到一份超多頁的 pdf\n以往都需要人工逐頁處理跟登打\n\n現在因為他們導入了新的 ERP 系統\n系統本身也能很簡單的就跟 AI 做串接\n又享受到 AI 模型的進步\n\n只需要在系統裡面做一部：上傳\n接著就放手交給 AI + 系統處理\n一個 PDF → 一百多筆資料 → 全自動出現在系統\n同仁只需要確認那些 AI 回報信心程度較低的項目就好\n\n一個小時的工作只剩下不到幾分鐘！\n如果你想知道這是哪套 ERP 系統 ↓","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":18,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":25,"first_seen":"2026-11-07T00:32:22+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZl3NHyAF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZl3NHyAF","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"歡迎洽詢 Odoo ERP \n找 @lupus_rr 評估自己的公司是否適合換成 Odoo\n\n享受簡單易用、又能根據需求客製化的 ERP 系統","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":